			"File": [
				"⣿⠇⠀⠀⠀",
				405,
				110
			],
			"Message": "refactor(Cocoon): Use environment variables for gRPC port configuration\n\nRefactor gRPC port binding to use environment variables instead of hardcoded values. Cocoon now reads MOUNTAIN_GRPC_PORT (defaults to 50051) for connecting to Mountain, and COCOON_GRPC_PORT (defaults to 50052) for its own server. This enables Mountain to dynamically assign ports when spawning Cocoon as a sidecar.\n\nAlso improve error handling by wrapping MountainClient.sendNotification calls with Effect.tryPromise and removing redundant Logger.Error calls in service catch blocks. These notifications are fire-and-forget and errors are already propagated through the Effect system.\n\nThe Target/ directory contains the newly built JavaScript output from these source changes.",
			"SHA": "a7513b0028075d830b255267c1662975f412bb15"
		},
